---
import Firm from '../layouts/Firm.astro';
import { photoUrl } from '../data/firm';
// Photos: free Unsplash licence, served from images.unsplash.com.
const heroPhoto = '1758691737278-3af15b37af48';
const workPhoto = '1542744173-8e7e53415bb0';
---
<Firm title="About" description="Kixlogic designs and builds custom AI apps around how a business works, runs Seekapedia, a public business data API, and offers HR consulting, recruiting and visa support.">
  <section class="hero hero-split">
    <div class="fw hs-in">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About Kixlogic</p>
        <h1 class="display xl">We build the app <mark>your work needs.</mark></h1>
        <p class="lede">Kixlogic designs and builds custom AI apps for businesses, runs Seekapedia, a public business data API, and still helps companies with the people side of the business: HR consulting, recruiting and visa support.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="photo">
        <img src={photoUrl(heroPhoto, 900, 1000)} alt="Two colleagues talking through a piece of work in a modern office" width="900" height="1000" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="fw split">
      <div><h2 class="display md">Our story</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Kixlogic began as a software company, building HR and business tools used on the web, inside Microsoft Office and on mobile. Building those products meant living inside the hiring, pay and compliance problems our users faced every day.</p>
        <p>That is still how we work. We start from the process that hurts, design the app around the people who do the work, and build it where they already are. Along the way we built Seekapedia, our own data product, which brings public records on companies into one API.</p>
        <p>The HR side of the company did not go away. We still recruit, consult and support visa filings, and it keeps us close to the problems our customers have.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band soft">
    <div class="fw split" style="align-items:center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="display md" style="margin-bottom:36px">How we work</h2>
        <figure class="photo wide" style="max-width:480px">
          <img src={photoUrl(workPhoto, 800, 600)} alt="A consultant presenting to a team around a meeting table" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>We design first, so you see the app before we build it.</li>
          <li>We talk through scope and price with you before work starts.</li>
          <li>We keep people in charge of the decisions that matter, including in the AI we build.</li>
          <li>We say what we will do, do it on the timeline we agreed, and tell you plainly when something is not a fit.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band navy">
    <div class="fw">
      <h2 class="display lg">Let's work <mark style="color:#0A1B4D">together.</mark></h2>
      <div style="margin-top:32px"><a class="pill" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Firm>
